{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The public response now builds a minimal reviewer object containing only the first name, and POST validation/identity checks happen before persistence. Update/delete now target the path’s review and recompute the aggregate from all remaining reviews with one-decimal HALF_UP rounding. I’m compiling the affected modules now."}}
